# Dombögen arch underside: the stone i m d of tile_arch (same top course)
# with the arch ring (voussoirs, joints m) and a curved soffit cut-out below,
# intrados edge d. Autotiled left/right only (the N bit only rounds the top
# corners): left end = springing, middle = crown (m depth band inside the intrados), right end =
# springing; a single tile is a small complete arch.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_arch_under
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
